<unity xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/practices/2010/unity">
    <!--
    <lang>
      <zh-CN>声明 Unity 配置命名空间与可解析程序集，限定容器按门户旧命名空间扫描类型。</zh-CN>
      <en>Declares the Unity configuration namespace and resolvable assemblies, limiting container type lookup to the legacy portal namespaces.</en>
    </lang>
    -->
    <namespace name="ASPNET.StarterKit.Portal" />
    <assembly name="Portal" />
    <assembly name="Portal.Components" />
    <assembly name="Portal.Components.Data" />
    <assembly name="Portal.Components.Data1" />

    <container>
        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>Unity 配置不保存真实连接串；Application_Start 从外置 connectionStrings.config 读取 Portal 连接串，并注册为 connectionString 命名实例。</zh-CN>
          <en>Unity configuration does not store the real connection string; Application_Start reads the Portal connection string from external connectionStrings.config and registers it as the named connectionString instance.</en>
        </lang>
        -->

        <instance name="testStr" type="string"
                  value="default UnityCfg" />

        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>P42 修复：门户安全区注册旧 EF 安全上下文，生命周期改为 transient（每解析一次新建实例），并通过启动期注册的 connectionString 命名实例注入外置连接串。原先的单例上下文会被并发请求（含并行的 WebResource.axd 子资源）共享，导致实时安全版本/角色查询在共享 DbContext 上竞态抛异常、被吞掉返回 0 而误签退活跃会话；每请求/瞬态实例彻底隔离并发读取。</zh-CN>
          <en>P42 fix: the portal security section registers the legacy EF security context with a transient lifetime (a new instance per resolve) and injects the external connection string through the startup-registered connectionString named instance. The former singleton context was shared by concurrent requests (including parallel WebResource.axd sub-resources); real-time security-version/role queries raced on that shared DbContext, threw, were swallowed into a 0 result, and wrongly signed out active sessions. Per-resolve instances fully isolate concurrent reads.</en>
        </lang>
        -->
        <register type="PortalSecurityDbContext" mapTo="PortalSecurityDbContext">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>P42 修复：用户数据访问契约映射到 UsersDb，生命周期改为 transient。原先的单例会在并发请求间共享同一 DbContext，使 Application_AuthenticateRequest 的实时安全版本/角色查询竞态失败并误签退用户；每解析一次新建实例可彻底隔离并发读取。</zh-CN>
          <en>P42 fix: the user data-access contract maps to UsersDb with a transient lifetime. The former singleton shared one DbContext across concurrent requests, so the real-time security-version/role queries in Application_AuthenticateRequest raced and wrongly signed out users; a new instance per resolve fully isolates concurrent reads.</en>
        </lang>
        -->
        <register type="IUsersDb" mapTo="UsersDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>P6.3 企业业务目录区注册组织、员工、绑定、资料确认、更正、业务申请、协作事项、参考数据和工作项服务。</zh-CN>
          <en>The P6.3 enterprise business directory section registers organization, employee, binding, profile confirmation, correction, business application, collaboration item, reference data, and work-item services.</en>
        </lang>
        -->
        <register type="PortalBizDbContext" mapTo="PortalBizDbContext">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <register type="IEmployeeDirectoryDb" mapTo="EmployeeDirectoryDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IEmployeeDirectoryAdminDb" mapTo="EmployeeDirectoryAdminDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IUserEmployeeBindingAdminDb" mapTo="UserEmployeeBindingAdminDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IEmployeeProfileConfirmationDb" mapTo="EmployeeProfileConfirmationDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IEmployeeProfileCorrectionRequestDb" mapTo="EmployeeProfileCorrectionRequestDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IBusinessApplicationDb" mapTo="BusinessApplicationDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="ICollaborationItemDb" mapTo="CollaborationItemDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IReferenceDataDb" mapTo="ReferenceDataDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IPortalWorkItemDb" mapTo="PortalWorkItemDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>
        <register type="ILeaveRequestDb" mapTo="LeaveRequestDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>
        <register type="IExpenseReimbursementDb" mapTo="ExpenseReimbursementDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IRolesDb" mapTo="RolesDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IPortalSecurity" mapTo="PortalSecurity">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>P42 修复：门户配置区注册旧 Tab、Module、Global 和运行时配置访问入口，生命周期由单例改为 transient。单例 DbContext 在并发子资源请求间共享会竞态；瞬态实例按解析隔离，消除该竞态（各仓储内部的只读缓存会随实例重建，属可接受的行为变化）。</zh-CN>
          <en>P42 fix: the portal configuration section registers legacy Tab, Module, Global, and runtime-configuration data-access entries, now with transient lifetimes instead of singleton. A singleton DbContext shared across concurrent sub-resource requests raced; transient instances isolate per resolve and remove the race (any read-only in-repository caches are rebuilt with each instance, an acceptable behavioral change).</en>
        </lang>
        -->

        <register type="PortalCfgDbContext" mapTo="PortalCfgDbContext">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <register type="IPortalDb" mapTo="PortalDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <register type="ITabsDb" mapTo="TabsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IModulesDb" mapTo="ModulesDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IModuleDefsDb" mapTo="ModuleDefsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IGlobalsDb" mapTo="GlobalsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>


        <!--
        <lang>
          <zh-CN>P42 修复：门户内容模块区注册旧模块数据访问实现；讨论区仍需要连接串构造参数，其余模块生命周期由单例改为 transient，与全数据层一致地消除共享 DbContext 的并发竞态。</zh-CN>
          <en>P42 fix: the portal module section registers legacy module data-access implementations; Discussions still requires a connection-string constructor argument, while the other modules now use a transient lifetime, consistent with the whole data layer to remove the shared-DbContext concurrency race.</en>
        </lang>
        -->
        <register type="PortalDbContext" mapTo="PortalDbContext">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <register type="IAnnouncementsDb" mapTo="AnnouncementsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IContactsDb" mapTo="ContactsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IDiscussionsDb" mapTo="DiscussionsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
            <constructor>
                <param name="connectionString" dependencyName="connectionString" dependencyType="string" />
            </constructor>
        </register>

        <register type="IDocumentsDb" mapTo="DocumentsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IEventsDb" mapTo="EventsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="IHtmlTextsDb" mapTo="HtmlTextsDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

        <register type="ILinksDb" mapTo="LinksDb">
            <lifetime type="transient" />
        </register>

    </container>
</unity>
